        "step_number": 8,
        "text": "Step 8: Test integer values of \\(k\\) to find the minimum value of \\(\\left| 28 - 7k \\right|\\):\n- If \\(k = 4\\), then \\(\\left| 28 - 7 \\cdot 4 \\right| = \\left| 28 - 28 \\right| = 0\\)."
      }
